  "abstract": "<jats:p>Ultracompact polarization-independent surface-reflective modulator with an organic electro-optic thin film is demonstrated. A 30-μm-diameter vertically coupled Fabry-Perot resonator is employed to experimentally demonstrate high modulation efficiency of 0.30 nm/V and 3-dB bandwidth of 40 GHz.</jats:p>",
